# Phone landscape (844 x 390, DPR 3): the title, a Practice deal from Play with the narrow status rail and
# the tray, a move by touch, the pause screen from the tray and Leave.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Daily Deal
frames 10
save title-landscape
touch =Play
until 300 =Collect
frames 60
save desk-landscape
touch =Hint
frames 20
touch =Undo
frames 10
touch =Pause
until 120 Resume
frames 10
save pause-landscape
touch =Leave deal
until 300 Daily Deal
